content:
Help me find the associations.  

#### Data:
These are the extracted domain objects and their associations:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Customer",
      "description": "Person or company using telecommunication services.",
      "attributes": [
        "Mobile Connection",
        "Financial Records"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Financial Records",
      "description": "Contains billing and payment history for a customer."
    },
    {
      "name": "Mobile Connection",
      "description": "Represents the active mobile service of a customer."
    },
    {
      "name": "Connection Request",
      "description": "Request made by a customer to start a new mobile connection.",
      "attributes": [
        "Service Plan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Service Plan",
      "description": "Defines pricing, data, and call limits for a connection."
    },
    {
      "name": "Customer Service Agent",
      "description": "Handles customer requests, updates, and issue reports."
    },
    {
      "name": "Network Outage Report",
      "description": "Report created when a customer experiences network problems."
    },
    {
      "name": "Network Bill",
      "description": "Record of charges for services used by a customer.",
      "attributes": [
        "Service Plan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Network Technician",
      "description": "Installs, tests, and repairs network connections."
    },
    {
      "name": "Network Installation",
      "description": "Setup process that activates a customer’s mobile connection.",
      "attributes": [
        "Signal Test"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Signal Test",
      "description": "A test to determine whether the signal is strong enough."
    },
    {
      "name": "Maintenance Ticket",
      "description": "Record of a service issue that needs technical repair."
    },
    {
      "name": "Maintenance Visit",
      "description": "On-site visit by a technician to repair or maintain a connection."
    },
    {
      "name": "Billing Officer",
      "description": "Prepares invoices and manages customer payments."
    },
    {
      "name": "Invoice",
      "description": "Document listing service charges and payment details."
    }
  ]
}
```

#### Task:
- Draw connections between objects that have an association. 
- Name the two related objects and add a description that captures the meaning of the association.
- Return the associations in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "associations": [
    {
      "from": "...",
      "to": "...",
      "description": "..."
    }
  ]
}
```

Here are the associations:
```json
{
  "associations": [
    {
      "from": "Customer",
      "to": "Connection Request",
      "description": "Customer sends Connection Request to start a mobile service."
    },
    {
      "from": "Customer Service Agent",
      "to": "Connection Request",
      "description": "Customer Service Agent receives and records Connection Request."
    },
    {
      "from": "Customer",
      "to": "Network Outage Report",
      "description": "Customer submits Network Outage Report when facing service issues."
    },
    {
      "from": "Network Outage Report",
      "to": "Customer Service Agent",
      "description": "Network Outage Report is reviewed by Customer Service Agent."
    },
    {
      "from": "Customer Service Agent",
      "to": "Network Technician",
      "description": "Customer Service Agent forwards service requests to Network Technician."
    },
    {
      "from": "Network Technician",
      "to": "Connection Request",
      "description": "Network Technician handles Connection Request for installation."
    },
    {
      "from": "Network Technician",
      "to": "Network Installation",
      "description": "Network Technician performs Network Installation at customer site."
    },
    {
      "from": "Network Installation",
      "to": "Mobile Connection",
      "description": "Network Installation establishes the Mobile Connection."
    },
    {
      "from": "Customer Service Agent",
      "to": "Maintenance Ticket",
      "description": "Customer Service Agent creates Maintenance Ticket for reported issues."
    },
    {
      "from": "Maintenance Ticket",
      "to": "Network Technician",
      "description": "Maintenance Ticket is assigned to Network Technician for repair."
    },
    {
      "from": "Network Technician",
      "to": "Maintenance Visit",
      "description": "Network Technician performs Maintenance Visit to fix the issue."
    },
    {
      "from": "Maintenance Visit",
      "to": "Mobile Connection",
      "description": "Maintenance Visit restores or improves the Mobile Connection."
    },
    {
      "from": "Billing Officer",
      "to": "Invoice",
      "description": "Billing Officer issues Invoice for customer services."
    },
    {
      "from": "Customer",
      "to": "Invoice",
      "description": "Customer receives Invoice for subscribed mobile services."
    },
    {
      "from": "Billing Officer",
      "to": "Financial Records",
      "description": "Billing Officer updates Financial Records with payment information."
    }
  ]
}
```
